            0.743,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Many torches in use today have a Light Emitting Diode (LED) lamp, instead of an incandescent lamp, as shown in Fig. 3.5."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.147,
            0.862,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": [
